  m_Name: unit_820998
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Sweet Dreamer Maeri
  unitId: 820998
  unitNumber: 8651
  description: "Once upon a time, there lived in a little cottage a sweet little
    girl named Maeri. She wanted not for company (that was what her fluffy friend
    Woolie was for), but she yearned to go on wonderful adventures like the ones
    from her stories. Being a small child, however, had its host of difficulties\u2014chief
    among them getting eaten in one bite by a ravenous bear or some other horrible
    monster. And there was also the matter of where; Maeri didn't exactly live in
    a place conducive to wanton acts of derring-do or saving maidens from monsters.The
    best Maeri could do was imagine, and how she had a talent for it! For the little
    girl frequently dozed off during the day, but became lively in the world of dreams.
    Between the pages of her favorite books pulsed a certain magic\u2014 one that
    brought her above and beyond her comfortable little cottage to snowbound townships
    and deep, luminous forests.But to passively observe was a chance wasted. Maeri
    wanted to be a part of these wonderful tales. Surely the people in the stories
    wouldn't think much of her; they were not real, after all!With the narration
    set firmly in her mind, the young girl set forth. A glittering snowscape unfolded
    before Maeri's eyes, framed on either side by frosty forests. Deep within the
    valley nestled an idyllic little village\u2014the first scene. The adventure
    was about to begin in earnest.Little did Maeri know, however, how profound an
    impact she would have in the world she believed was firmly in the realm of relaxed
    fantasy. For the inhabitants of that snowy world, it was no dream at all..."
  summonDesc: Umm...Hi!<br>I'm Maeri! I come from, umm, outside!<br>...This is the
    Dream World, right?
  fusionDesc: '*yawn*<br>Is it already time for snacks?<br>Mmm...chips! Chocolate...chips?'
  evoDesc: Hehe. See?<br>That's 'cause I'm always right!<br>...Right, Woolie?
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
